{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner1.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Picture this: you're a penguin. Life at the North Pole? Freezing. Dull. Zero prospects (especially with the ladies). Time to break free! Find some actual fun, like in good old YetiSports!<br>Your tools? A best bear buddy... and a bat. What could go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_1_2.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner2.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From scorching deserts to a moose butt - this ain't your average penguin vacation. Bounce off bewildered seals, become a snowball of doom, hitch a ride on a whale, and surf on giant mushrooms. Successfully navigate a lake? Bonus points! Moose-back riding? Definitely a thing. Impale yourself on a pine tree? Probably. All for love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner6.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Failure is an option! Because..\u00a0You. Will. Always. Fail. Hilariously.\u00a0You'll get eaten by piranhas, become a moose's new hat, get stuck in a tree, and possibly abducted by a creepy green dude. But hey, at least you'll fail in style. The real question is: how far can you get before you fail spectacularly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner3.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who needs fish when you have rocket-powered frying pans and the freakin' Infinity Gauntlet? Pick your bat - from humble frying pan to the Eiffel Tower, a trusty club, or the ultimate power glove. Boost your launch power, flight, bounce, and max speed. Prepare for penguin-launching mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner5.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your quest for better life you'll even reach the freakin' space. So yeah, we say this game IS about space! It's beautiful. (And a great place to launch a penguin.) Your bear buddy's skills and your epic bat collection will get you there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_6.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner4.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you're the ultimate penguin launcher? Prove it. Endless replayability, global leaderboards - compete with friends and foes. Brag about your distance, your style, your collection of ludicrous bats.\u00a0Dominate the leaderboards. Become a legend. Or at least, a slightly less unsuccessful penguin launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697340?t=1749486039","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697340?t=1749486039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/124f1c263f4b26c47f3edf409258741b6f51970f/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1749486039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/124f1c263f4b26c47f3edf409258741b6f51970f/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1749486039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3774120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner1.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Picture this: you're a penguin. Life at the North Pole? Freezing. Dull. Zero prospects (especially with the ladies). Time to break free! Find some actual fun, like in good old YetiSports!<br>Your tools? A best bear buddy... and a bat. What could go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_1_2.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner2.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From scorching deserts to a moose butt - this ain't your average penguin vacation. Bounce off bewildered seals, become a snowball of doom, hitch a ride on a whale, and surf on giant mushrooms. Successfully navigate a lake? Bonus points! Moose-back riding? Definitely a thing. Impale yourself on a pine tree? Probably. All for love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner6.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Failure is an option! Because..\u00a0You. Will. Always. Fail. Hilariously.\u00a0You'll get eaten by piranhas, become a moose's new hat, get stuck in a tree, and possibly abducted by a creepy green dude. But hey, at least you'll fail in style. The real question is: how far can you get before you fail spectacularly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner3.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who needs fish when you have rocket-powered frying pans and the freakin' Infinity Gauntlet? Pick your bat - from humble frying pan to the Eiffel Tower, a trusty club, or the ultimate power glove. Boost your launch power, flight, bounce, and max speed. Prepare for penguin-launching mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner5.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your quest for better life you'll even reach the freakin' space. So yeah, we say this game IS about space! It's beautiful. (And a great place to launch a penguin.) Your bear buddy's skills and your epic bat collection will get you there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Gif_6.gif?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/Banner4.png?t=1749486039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you're the ultimate penguin launcher? Prove it. Endless replayability, global leaderboards - compete with friends and foes. Brag about your distance, your style, your collection of ludicrous bats.\u00a0Dominate the leaderboards. Become a legend. Or at least, a slightly less unsuccessful penguin launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Playgendary","JoyBits Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/8a250f8f32503d3c997a7c08508e1fae2e409e19/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1749486039","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146777,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146777/movie480.mp4?t=1749140244","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146777/movie_max.mp4?t=1749140244"},"name":"Bouncemasters | Official Announcement Trailer 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146777/603d48c183d656c619c578ba4a3674d3c62e989a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749140244","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146777/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749140244","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146777/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749140244"}}],"name":"Bouncemasters","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><